{"parse": {"title": "8TH-01", "pageid": 69774, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/7TH-30\" title=\"7TH-30\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">8TH-01</span><a href=\"/wiki/8TH-02\" title=\"8TH-02\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">8TH</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">01</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.AD.A4.E5.8D.B3.E6.AD.A3.E4.B9.89\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"此即正义\">此即正义</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 此即正义</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Unshakable Justice</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>面<span class=\"color-value\"></span>对<span class=\"color-value\"></span>行<span class=\"color-value\"></span>刑<span class=\"color-value\"></span>队<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>你<span class=\"color-value\"></span>得<span class=\"color-value\"></span>守<span class=\"color-value\"></span>住<span class=\"color-value\"></span>自<span class=\"color-value\"></span>己<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>骨<span class=\"color-value\"></span>气<span class=\"color-value\"></span>—<span class=\"color-value\"></span>—<span class=\"color-value\"></span>当<span class=\"color-value\"></span>叛<span class=\"color-value\"></span>徒<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>骨<span class=\"color-value\"></span>气<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 10801</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛佩拉：</div><div>懦夫……逃兵……叛徒！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛佩拉：</div><div>这是你们的选择，你们的代价。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛佩拉：</div><div>芝诺绝不容忍！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛佩拉：</div><div>行刑队！抬枪！预备——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛佩拉：</div><div>射击！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_2_bg_zhinuojidi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_2_bg_zhinuojidi\"><img alt=\"2_2_bg_zhinuojidi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/Cg-2_2_bg_zhinuojidi.png/600px-Cg-2_2_bg_zhinuojidi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/Cg-2_2_bg_zhinuojidi.png/900px-Cg-2_2_bg_zhinuojidi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/Cg-2_2_bg_zhinuojidi.png/1200px-Cg-2_2_bg_zhinuojidi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔将军：</div><div>很抱歉让你看到这一幕。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔将军：</div><div>洛佩拉枪法很准，不过，把枪口对准曾经的同袍兄弟，对芝诺军人来说是种耻辱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔将军：</div><div>这是我的失职。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>顺着洛佩拉的枪口所指，士兵们倒在了荒草与尘埃中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>鲜血漫出。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔将军：</div><div>洛佩拉抓回了叛徒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310213.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-310213.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310213.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310213.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-310213.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310213.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-310213.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310213.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛佩拉：</div><div>法医核验。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310213.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-310213.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310213.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310213.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-310213.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310213.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-310213.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310213.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛佩拉：</div><div>其余人，收队！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>硝烟过后，士兵列队离开。军医登场，一一查验死者。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>行刑者将步枪交给侍从，摘下手套，转身面向圣保罗灼目的烈日与廊柱阴影下的伊戈尔将军。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a9/HeadIconSmall-310201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a9/HeadIconSmall-310201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a9/HeadIconSmall-310201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛佩拉：</div><div>行刑完毕，将军。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>微笑极少出现在这位久经沙场的老将脸上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>伊戈尔点点头，那双鹰一样的眼中，流露出对养女的赞许。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔将军：</div><div>做得很好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>行刑者敬礼致意，随后跟上士兵队伍，离开刑场。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔将军：</div><div>接连发生意外，真是可耻。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>老将军面露难色，近期发生的士兵叛逃事件就像不久前泄露的那段影像，将芝诺军中尴尬的现状暴露无遗。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>这些孬种犯了什么事？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔将军：</div><div>逃兵，杀死长官之后叛逃。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>哈，那的确该死。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔将军：</div><div>莫莉德尔副官正在竭力调查基地中的潜在叛乱分子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔将军：</div><div>这里被天使兄弟会渗透得很严重。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔将军：</div><div>有证据显示重塑之手也在圣保罗活动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>重塑之手？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……重塑之手一直与天使兄弟会纠缠不清。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>我以为他们只会以“启明会”的身份活动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>明明阿尔卡纳已经死亡……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔将军：</div><div>是的，在真空弹中灰飞烟灭。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>将军亲自下令，曾叱嗟风云的那位女士……肉身自爆炸中踪迹全无。<br />毁灭从天而降，如同硫磺与死亡从云间坠落。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>而基地的刑场上，阳光与不忠者的鲜血流过遍地荒草。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>唔……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>滚烫的初夏在额头灼烧，汗水不住流下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔将军：</div><div>圣保罗的太阳一向这样，你很快也会适应它。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>南半球的初夏热情得有些难以招架。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>我经历过比这更难受的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>在一些并不愉快的地方。山、沙子、雪山和山间的鹰……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔将军：</div><div>啊，那儿，我记得……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔将军：</div><div>是的，很少有地方比那儿残酷，也很少有战争比发生在那儿的更悲哀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔将军：</div><div>行刑结束了。司辰、红弩箭中尉，我们回室内谈吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>会议让头儿去就行，我没兴趣。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>飞行员灌下一口甜酒，但这不是她爱喝的生命之水。酒里没有北方那股雪渣子的味道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她一定不喜欢这股慵懒而又醉醺醺的味道，但基地能提供给她的只有这些了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在圣保罗，跨国公司提供的碳酸汽水往往比干净的水更便宜，而比汽水更便宜的，则是酒，取之不尽的朗姆酒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>我去找苏芙比玩玩儿，就这样。Пока!</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔将军：</div><div>在基地里，别忘了纪律，很多地区已经荒废了，不要离开有卫兵巡守的地方。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-bangongshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"bangongshi\"><img alt=\"bangongshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Cg-bangongshi.png/600px-Cg-bangongshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Cg-bangongshi.png/900px-Cg-bangongshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Cg-bangongshi.png/1200px-Cg-bangongshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一间朴素的办公室，桌面放着军用地图和电话，以及数个随意堆放着的小骰子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔将军：</div><div>《UTTU》杂志有一位叫做“兀尔德”的投稿人，在被回溯的每个时代我们都找到了她的署名稿件。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"516411.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-516411.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-516411.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"516411.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-516411.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-516411.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-516411.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-516411.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔将军：</div><div>是有人在共用这个笔名，还是说……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>这位自由撰稿人一直没有被“暴雨”回溯……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>——“暴雨”，并没有带走她？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>不久前，德克萨斯的数羊羔小姐提供了一些信息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>“这份稿件从圣保罗的荣军院寄来。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔将军：</div><div>荣军院？那儿有位盲眼医生，也许你可以去见见她，就在圣保罗城里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔将军：</div><div>你来的时机很合适，这儿的上任长官卡洛斯是个蠢货，竟然被自己的部下在这间办公室里枪杀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>老将军转过身去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔将军：</div><div>好消息是我们已经追回了大部分叛徒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>是刚才被处决的那批人……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔将军：</div><div>是的。洛佩拉突袭了兄弟会在上校庄园的据点，重创了他们和重塑之手的势力。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔将军：</div><div>虽然行动鲁莽，但她干得不错。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>老将军对刚才指挥行刑的少女，似乎评价颇高。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>冷酷，肃杀，决绝——和她柑橘般甜美热烈的橙发却有些格格不入。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>伊戈尔将军，接下来的行动我需要您的帮助。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>需要熟悉当地的人员，需要交通工具，需要情报……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>如果能得到芝诺伙伴的协助，我想，一切会顺利得多。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔将军：</div><div>我会尽力满足你的需求，但这儿的情况比我想象中更糟糕。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这儿的十七座塔楼和二十二个庭院都曾有驻军巡逻。可现在大半已经荒废，沦为了杂草与食雨甲虫的乐园。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔将军：</div><div>我的副官莫莉德尔中尉会尽快替你筹办这些事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔将军：</div><div>而洛佩拉……她很熟悉那座城市，可以做你的向导。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>老将军为基地的现状而叹气，但也尽力提供了他能提供的一切援助。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔将军：</div><div>除此之外，我也有一个请求，希望你能答应。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他显得很无奈。芝诺的窘境就像这座杂草丛生的基地，已不再有它曾经的辉煌与强大。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>如果我能帮上您的话，将军。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔将军：</div><div>那位叫红弩箭的年轻中尉，希望她能暂时留在这里，我手下的新兵急需一位可靠的教官。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>只要她本人不反对。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔将军：</div><div>谢谢你的理解。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔将军：</div><div>回去见见你的朋友们吧，莫莉德尔中尉应该也在会客室照顾她俩。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "8TH-01"}}